  message: "PHASE 0 RE-VERIFICATION AT TIP, 2026-08-25, dev e41a655d6d. REPRODUCES.\n\n    load_catalog('cobol')  -> is_supported=False, status='provenance_declared'\n    IoBoundaryCatalog field defaults: is_supported=True, status='provenance_declared'\n    controls: load_catalog('go') -> 'in_progress'\n              load_catalog('python') -> 'provenance_declared'\n\nA language with no catalogue file still reads as citation-backed. Confirmed as\na Phase 1 (fail-open) member of the campaign: \"never enumerated\" must not be\nspelled the same way as \"enumerated and cited\"."  # 080f
